          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata omusaatsa yesi naba nakona ninaye, obukaalibwe nibuba khuye, abe mwibilu tsindaalo musaafu; kata buli shitali eshia akonakhwo shikwe eshiomusilo.",
          "type": "text",
